      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$f(x) = 2x^{2} - 10x + 4$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>Minimum is $$- 17 2 - 17 2$$ and occurs at $$5 2 . 5 2 .$$ Axis of symmetry is $$x= 5 2 . x= 5 2 .$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
